-- Flavor text for normal monsters, shown in the card inspector where an
-- effect monster shows its effect. A separate field from "text": a card with
-- text is drawn and played as an effect monster. Sourced from the TCG card of
-- the same name (YGOPRODeck, Normal Monsters only); the rest have none.
-- Only sets it where a card has no flavor yet, so admin edits survive.

